            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe1s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Florial Garden Centre in Nessebar is pleased to announce a new shipment of olive trees from sunny Spain. We offer trees in different sizes and varieties so you can find the right addition to your garden."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe2",
            "_type": "image",
            "alt": "Olive tree in Nessebar",
            "asset": {
              "_ref": "image-5bda979a0ddf2d9e4547de76a455c905878b8087-600x1000-jpg",
              "_type": "reference"
            }
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe3",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe3s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Why choose an olive tree?"
              }
            ],
            "style": "h3"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe4",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe4s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Beauty and resilience. Olive trees have an elegant appearance throughout the year. Their small, glossy, waxy leaves help them cope with high temperatures."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe5",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe5s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Practical benefits. An olive tree is both an ornamental feature and a source of tasty fruit. Olives are used to produce the well-known olive oil, rich in vitamins and antioxidants."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe6",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe6s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Hardiness. Olive trees adapt to poor soils, tolerate drought and may withstand temperatures down to around −15°C, depending on the variety and growing conditions."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe7",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe7s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Caring for olive trees"
              }
            ],
            "style": "h3"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe8",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe8s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Olive trees do not require complicated care, but a few basic rules help them thrive."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe9",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe9s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Light. Choose an open, sunny position; olive trees do not do well in shade."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe10",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe10s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Watering. Water moderately. Pay particular attention to soil moisture at the beginning of the growing season and while fruit is forming."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe11",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe11s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Pruning. Regular pruning encourages new shoots and can improve the harvest."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe12",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "oe12s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Wind protection. In our region, olive trees can be sensitive to cold winds. Plant them in a sheltered spot, such as beside a house wall or hedge."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "oe13",
